<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pl">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1,viewport-fit=cover" />
<title>Prawda i Kłamstwo — rozmowy</title>
<link rel="icon" href="data:;base64,iVBORw0KGgo=">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg1: #FFF8F2;
    --bg2: #F3EEF9;
    --card: #FFFFFF;
    --accent: #7D5A50;
    --muted: #6b6b6b;
    --soft: #EAD9C9;
    --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
    --round: 14px;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box}
  html,body{height:100%}
  body{
    margin:0;
    font-family: Inter, "Segoe UI", Roboto, system-ui, -apple-system, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    padding:18px;
    -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  }

  .app{
    width:100%;
    max-width:520px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.78), rgba(250,245,240,0.85));
    border-radius: 18px;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(40,30,20,0.12);
    padding:18px;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    gap:12px;
    min-height:640px;
  }

  header{
    display:flex;
    gap:12px;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between;
  }
  .title{
    display:flex;
    gap:10px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  .logo{
    width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;
    background: conic-gradient(#FFEBD6,#F6E7FF,#E8F7F0);
    display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    font-weight:700;color:var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(125,90,80,0.12);
  }
  h1{font-size:1.05rem;margin:0;color:var(--accent)}
  p.lead{margin:0;font-size:0.86rem;color:var(--muted)}

  .controls{
    display:flex;
    gap:8px;
    align-items:center;
  }
  select, button.small{
    border-radius:10px;padding:8px 10px;border:none;background:var(--soft);
    color:var(--accent);font-weight:600;
    box-shadow: 0 3px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);
  }

  main{flex:1;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;align-items:stretch;justify-content:center;padding:6px 2px;}
  .card{
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.95), rgba(255,255,255,0.9));
    border-radius:var(--round);padding:18px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(30,20,10,0.06);
  }
  .question{
    font-size:1.2rem;color: #362f2a;line-height:1.4;min-height:72px;
  }
  .meta{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:0.85rem;margin-top:6px}

  .buttons{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}
  .btn{
    flex:1 1 45%;
    padding:14px 12px;border-radius:12px;border:none;font-size:1rem;font-weight:700;
    color:white;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 6px 14px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
  }
  .truth{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#5FBF8C,#3DAA73)}
  .lie{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#FF8B94,#E7606B)}
  .ghost{background:transparent;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);color:var(--accent);font-weight:600}

  .reflection{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(240,240,240,0.6), rgba(250,250,250,0.6));color:var(--muted);font-style:italic}

  footer{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:6px}
  .small-info{font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--muted)}

  .link-ui{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}
  .link-field{padding:8px 10px;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.06);font-size:0.9rem;min-width:150px;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}

  .center{text-align:center}
  /* responsive */
  @media (max-width:420px){
    .app{padding:14px;border-radius:12px}
    .btn{font-size:0.95rem;padding:12px}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="app" role="application">
  <header>
    <div class="title">
      <div class="logo">P&K</div>
      <div>
        <h1>Prawda i Kłamstwo</h1>
        <p class="lead">Krótka gra, która otwiera rozmowę. 🌿</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="controls">
      <select id="modeSelect" title="Wybierz tryb">
        <option value="solo">Solo</option>
        <option value="link">Gra przez link</option>
      </select>
      <button class="small" id="newRoundBtn">Nowa tura</button>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="card">
      <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
        <div>
          <strong style="color:var(--accent)">Kategoria:</strong>
          <select id="categorySelect" style="margin-left:8px;border-radius:10px;padding:6px 8px;border:none;background:var(--soft)">
            <option value="mix">Mieszane</option>
            <option value="emotions">Emocje</option>
            <option value="relations">Relacje</option>
            <option value="dreams">Marzenia</option>
            <option value="light">Lekkość</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="meta" id="progressMeta">Pytanie 1/1</div>
      </div>

      <div style="height:14px"></div>

      <div id="qCard" class="question card" aria-live="polite"></div>

      <div class="buttons" style="margin-top:8px">
        <button class="btn truth" id="truthBtn">✅ Prawda</button>
        <button class="btn lie" id="lieBtn">❌ Kłamstwo</button>
      </div>

      <div id="postArea" style="margin-top:12px">
        <div id="reflection" class="reflection" style="display:none"></div>
      </div>

      <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap">
        <button class="ghost" id="nextBtn">Następne pytanie 🔄</button>
        <button class="ghost" id="shareBtn">Utwórz link / Kopiuj</button>
        <button class="ghost" id="shuffleBtn">Przemieszaj pytania</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card small center" style="font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--muted)">
      <div style="margin-bottom:8px">Tryb Link — utwórz link i wyślij drugiej osobie. Osoba otwierająca link zobaczy to samo pytanie (na tym etapie host musi aktualizować link, aby przejść dalej).</div>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:center">
        <div class="link-field" id="linkField">Brak linku</div>
        <button class="ghost" id="copyLinkBtn">Kopiuj</button>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="small-info">Tryb: <span id="modeLabel">Solo</span></div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
      <div style="font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--muted)">Udostępnij i rozmawiaj. Brak ocen. 💬</div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</div>

